   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Measuring machine »zenit« </h3> <h1> Professional measurement of cutterheads </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Do you want to set your face and corner cutterheads precisely to guarantee the accuracy and flatness of your workpieces? Do you want to increase the service life of your tool cutting edges in order to drastically reduce your production and tool costs?</strong></p> <p>No problem with ZOLLER »zenit«: the high-precision presetting and measuring machine with ergonomic seat workstation for cutterheads and tools of all kinds increases the quality of your workpieces and reduces costs.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
